 December 1922)uhttp://www3.cpdl.org/wiki/index.php/Helgi_Helgason00400nz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092100002900105400003000134670010200164nr 96028828 DLC19960808053623.0960807n| acannaab|          |a aaa     c  anr 96028828   aNjPcNjP0 aJón Stefansson,d1946-1 aStefansson, Jón,d1946-  aAn anthology of Icelandic choral music, 1983:blabel (cond. Jón Stefansson) container (b. 1946)00589cz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010004500075040002800120100003100148400003200179670009800211670013400309nr 96028830 DLC20140106134041.0960807n| azannaabn          |a aaa     c  anr 96028830 zno 98006107 zn 2011078520  aNjPbengerdacNjPdDLC0 aJón Ásgeirsson,d1928-1 aÁsgeirsson, Jón,d1928-  aAn anthology of Icelandic choral music, 1983:blabel (Jón Ásgeirsson) container (b. 1928)  aBlásarakvintett Reykjavíkur. Íslensk tónlist fyrir tréblásara [SR] 1986:blabel (Jón Ásgeirsson) insert (b. 1928)00430nz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002100092100003100113670006400144670008800208nr 96028844 DLC19960815051154.4960807n| acannaab|           n aaa     c  anr 96028844   aCaQMCCAcCaQMCCA1 aCastella, Vincenzo,d1952-  aZone, Vincenzo Castella, c1991:bp. 96 (b. in Naples, 1952)  aGeorge Eastman House database, Aug. 7, 1996b(Castella, Vincenzo, b. 1952 in Italy)00647cz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002300092110006000115667009500175670014800270670008300418nr 96028855 DLC20120731105546.0960807n| acannaab           |n ana     c  anr 96028855   aMWAbengcMWAdDLC2 aRepublican Party (Conn. : 1792-1828).bState Convention  aTHIS 1XX FIELD CANNOT BE USED UNDER RDA UNTIL THIS RECORD HAS BEEN REVIEWED AND/OR UPDATED  aIts (1828 : Middletown, Conn.). Address to the people of Connecticut, adopted at the State Convention held at 