treetcar in Louisville on May 10, 1902, he died May 13, 1902.)00761cz  a2200181n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001800092100003400110400003400144400003400178400003400212670013700246670013500383670006100518nr 96034162 DLC19971209053933.0960923n| acannaab|          |a aaa     c  anr 96034162   aUPBcUPBdUPB1 aGeorges, Heinrich,d1852-19211 aGeorgii, Henricus,d1852-19211 aGeorges, Henricus,d1852-19211 aGeorgii, Heinrich,d1852-1921  aTiberi Claudi Donati ad Tiberium Claudium Maximum Dnatianum filium suum interpretationes Vergilianae, 1969:bt.p. (Henricus Georgii)  aRLIN, 9/23/96b(hdg.: Georges, Heinrich, 1852-1921; usage: Heinrich Georges, Henricus Georges, Henricus Georgii [nominative case])  aDie antike ⁴neiskritik, 1971:bt.p. (Heinrich Georgii)00400nz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092110003300105410001000138670011800148nr 96034167 DLC19960925052454.2960923n| acannaab|          |a anc     c  anr 96034167   aNICcNIC2 aInstitute of Energy Malaysia2 aInTeM  aProceedings of the Second International Energy Conference ... c1994:bt.p. (Institute of Energy Malaysia (InTeM))00540cz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002300092111003600115411003700151667009500188670011100283nr 96034169 DLC20120806100208.0960923n| acannaab           |a ana     c  anr 96034169   aNICbengcNICdDLC2 aInternational Energy Conference2 aEnergy Conference, International  aTHIS 1XX FIELD CANNOT BE USED UNDER RDA UNTIL THIS RECORD HAS BEEN REVIEWED AND/OR UPDATED  aProceedings of the Second International Energy Conference ... c1994:bt.p. (Kuala Lumpur, 17-19 Aug. 1992)00941cz  a2200241n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003300115130001000148380002300158400005400181400004500235400001900280430003200299430002300331670004600354670013200400670006200532670010500