Core Group” of advisers for the development of a major cultural center in Arles, France; he is a frequent contributor to ArtReview, the British contemporary art magazine; he was Director of the Public Art Fund in New York City from 1996-2005; he graduated from the University of Glasgow in 1989 with an M.A. in Philosophy and Italian; he studied philosophy, aesthetics and semiotics at the University of Bologna from 1985-1987; he is a faculty and graduate committee member of the Center for Curatorial Studies at Bard College)00528cz  a2200157n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002800092053001500120100003000135400002100165670005800186670012600244nr 96038292 DLC20210305114709.0961023n| azannaab           |a aaa     c  anr 96038292   aNNUbengerdacNNUdDLC 0aPR6031.E191 aPearn, V. A.q(Violet A.)1 aPearn, Violet A.  aLove on the happy hill, 1911:bt.p. (Violet A. Pearn)  aRLIN, Oct. 23, 1996b(hdg.: Pearn, V. A. (Violet A.); Pearn, Violet A.; usage: V.A. Pearn; Violet A. Pearn; Violet Pearn)00300nz  a2200121n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092100001900105670005400124nr 96038295 DLC19961107052103.9961023n| acannaab|          |n aaa     c  anr 96038295   aNNUcNNU1 aNeville, Julia  aThe sleeping village, 1912:bt.p. (Julia Neville)00454cz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002500092100002600117400002600143670007800169670006100247nr 96038298 DLC20001111071515.0961023n| acannaabn          |a aaa     c  anr 96038298   aNNUbengcNNUdOCoLC1 aPerry, Henry Ten Eyck1 aTen Eyck Perry, Henry  aThe comic spirit in Restoration drama, 1925:bt.p. (Henry Ten Eyck Perry)  aLC in RLIN, Oct. 22, 1996b(hdg.: Perry, Henry Ten Eyck)00510nz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092100004400105400003500149670005900184670012100243nr 96038300 DLC19961107052126.7961023n| a