ICd(1994 April 15) 0aAgreement Establishing the World Trade Organizationd(1994 April 15).nAnnex 1C,pAgreement on Trade-related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights 0aAgreement on Trade-Related Intellectual Property Rightsd(1994 April 15) 0aAgreement on TRIPsd(1994 April 15) 0aGuan mao zong xie ding yu mao yi you guan de zhi shi can quan xie ding (1994 April 15) 0aIttifāqīyat al-Jawānib al-Muttaṣilah bi-al-Tijārah min Ḥuqūq al-Milkīyah al-Fikrīyah (1994 April 15) 0aSoglashenie po torgovym aspektam prav intellektualʹnoĭ sobstvennostid(1994 April 15) 0aTRIPsd(1994 April 15) 0aTRIPs Agreementd(1994 April 15) 0aUruguay Round Agreement on Trade-Related Intellectual Property Rightsd(1994 April 15) 0aWorld Trade Organization-TRIPs Agreementd(1994 April 15) 0aWTO Agreement on Trade Related Intellectual Property Rightsd(1994 April 15) 0aWTO-TRIPs Agreementd(1994 April 15) 0wnneaaAgreement on Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rightsd(1994)  aFrom GATT to TRIPs ... 1996:bt.p. (Agreement on Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights) p. 2 (the official abbreviation for the Agreement is Agreement on TRIPs or simply TRIPs Agreement ... frequently simply called TRIPs)  aIntellectual property & international trade, 1996:bp. 10 (TRIPS Agreement; a multilateral agreement annexed to the Agreement establishing the World Trade Organization)  aInternational legal materials, 1994:bp. 81 (General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade - Multilateral Trade Negotiations (The Uruguay Round); Agreement on Trade-related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights, Including Trade in Counterfeit Goods; Dec. 15, 1993) p. 1128 (The phrase "Including Trade in Counterfeit Goods" was deleted from the title of the April 15, 1994 agreement) p. 1197 (Annex 1C, Agreement on Trade-related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights)  aThe TRIPS Agreement, 1997:bt.p. (Uruguay Round Agreement on Trade-Related Intellectual Property Rights) foreword (Agreement on Trade-Related Intellectual Property Rights (TRIPS))  aGuo ji ji shu zhuan rang fa lü yu shi wu, 2000:bp. 533 (Guan mao zong xie ding yu mao yi you guan de zhi shi can quan xie ding; Signed June 15, 1994)  aMaḥmūd, M. J.al-D. M. al-Ḥimāyah al-dawlīyah li-barāʼāt al-ikhtirāʻ, 2003:bp. 419 (Ittifāqīyat al-Jawānib al-Muttaṣilah bi-al-Tijārah min Ḥuqūq al-Milkīyah al-Fikrīyah)  aWTO Agreement on Trade Related Intellectual Property Rights (TRIPS) 2002.  aPravo intellektualʹnoĭ sobstvennosti, 2000:bp. 44 (Soglashenie po torgovym aspektam prav intellektualʹnoĭ sobstvennosti)  aVelásquez, G. L'accès aux médicaments, 2009bp. 4 of cover (ADPIC - Accord sur les aspects des droits de propriété intellectuelle qui touchent au commerce)  aHukum hak cipta Indonesia, 2010:bt.p. (World Trade Organization/WTO-TRIPs Agreement)  aWorld Trade Organization website, May 8, 2014:btrade topics, TRIPS (Agreement on Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights; the TRIPS Agreement is Annex 1C of the Marrakesh Agreement Establishing the World Trade Organization, signed in Marrakesh, Morocco on 15 April 1994.)  aWorld Intellectual Property Organization website, May 8, 2014:bWIPO Lex (Agreement on Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights (TRIPS Agreement); adopted on April 15, 1994 at Marrakesh; entry into force on January 1, 1995)  aBritannica.com, academic edition, May 8, 2014:bintellectual property law, World Trade Organization and intellectual property law (The Agreement on Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights (commonly known as TRIPS) has contributed greatly to the expansion of intellectual-property law. Negotiated as part of the Uruguay Round (1986-1994) of the General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade (GATT), the TRIPS Agreement obligates members of the World Trade Organization (WTO) to establish and enforce minimum levels of copyright, patent, and trademark protection within their jurisdictions. Countries that fail to do so are subject to various WTO-administered trade sanctions.)00591cz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002300092111004100115411004900156667009500205670014500300nr 96041098 DLC20120730125420.0961115n| acannaab           |a ana     c  anr 96041098   aNjPbengcNjPdDLC2 aSouthcon/96d(1996 :cOrlando, Fla.)2 aSouthcon Conferenced(1996 :cOrlando, Fla.)  aTHIS 1XX FIELD CANNOT BE USED UNDER RDA UNTIL THIS RECORD HAS BEEN REVIEWED AND/OR UPDATED  aSouthcon/96, c1996:bt.p. (Orange County Convention Center, Orlando, Florida, June 25-27, 1996) t.p. verso (1996 Southcon Conference Record)00452nz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001700092100005600109400004300165670011000208nr 96041099 DLC19961116052157.5961115n| acannaab|          |a aaa        anr 96041099   aDLC-RcDLC-R1 aKiyota, Minoru,d1923-tNikkei hangyakuji.lEnglish1 aKiyota, Minoru,d1923-tBeyond loyalty  aHis Beyond loyalty, 1997:bCIP p. 9 (orig. Japanese title: Nikkei hangyakuji; published in Japan in 1990)01225cz  a2200253n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092040003400115046000900149100003300158400004200191400004200233400004200275400004100317400003500358400004100393670015000434670017200584670005700756670015800813nr 96041115 DLC20130311084256.0961115n| azannaabn          |a aaa     c  anr 96041115   a(OCoLC)oca04212430  aNjPbengerdacNjPdMiEMdDLC  g19170 aGabrahiwot Baykadagn,d-19171 wnneaaBaykadagn, Gabrahiwot,dd. 19171 aBaykedagne, Guebrè-Heywet̀,d-19170 aGabra Ḥeywat Bāykadāñ,d-19170 wnneaaGabrahiwot Baykadagn,dd. 19170 aGebre-Hiywet Baykedagn,d-19170 aGuebrè-Heywet̀ Baykedagne,d-1917  aState & economy of early 20th century Ethiopia, c1995:bt.p. (Gabrahiwot Baykadagn) cover p. 4 (b. in Ethiopia ca. 1886, d. 1917; medical doctor)  aLC in OCLC, Aug. 