 of the Gumanitarnyĭ fakulʹtet of the Irkutskiĭ gosudarstvennyĭ universitet (then known as the Vostochno-Sibirskiĭ gosudarstvennyĭ universitet)[no publs. in LC data base]. On 11 August 1930 the otdelenie was reorganized as the independent Sibirskiĭ finansovo-ėkonomicheskiĭ institut (SFĖI)[no publs. in LC data base]. By 1939 the SFĖI has been reorganized as the Irkutskiĭ finansovo-ėkonomicheskiĭ institut (IFĖI). In 1965 the institute was again renamed as the Irkutskiĭ institut narodnogo khozi︠a︡ĭstva. In 1993 the institute was elevated in status, and renamed the Irkutskai︠a︡ gosudarstvennai︠a︡ ėkonomicheskai︠a︡ akademii︠a︡ (IGĖA). In 2002 the academy was renamed as the Baĭkalʹskiĭ gosudarstvennyĭ universitet ėkonomika i prava);aLC data base, 03-11-03 (hdgs.: Baĭkalʹskiĭ gosudarstvennyĭ universitet ėkonomika [sic] i prava; Irkutskiĭ institut narodnogo khozi︠a︡ĭstva)00446nz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092100003700105400002600142670005200168670008000220nr 97007613 DLC19970227053058.8970226n| acannaab|          |a aaa     c  anr 97007613   aCStcCSt1 aDrummond, John D.q(John Dorman)1 aDrummond, John Dorman  aBlue for a girl, 1960:bt.p. (John D. Drummond)  aLC in RLIN, 2/26/97b(hdg.: Drummond, John Dorman; usage: John D. Drummond)01185cz  a2200313n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075035002300092035001800115040004200133046000700175100002400182370002900206372002800235374002300263375001800286377000800304378002000312400003200332400003400364400005400398500002500452667004700477670007200524670012700596670014800723nr 97007614 DLC20200522115133.0970226n| azannaabn          |b aaa     c  anr 97007614   a(OCoLC)oca04282577  a(Uk)005604150  aNICbengerdacNICdDLCdInUdUkdDLC  s201 aShcherbakova, M. I.  cRussia (Federation)2naf  aRussian philology2lcsh  aPhilologists2lcsh  aFemales2lcsh  arus  qMarina Ivanovna1 