s of South Australia, where he still lives with his wife and family. ...  output includes over forty novels for readers all ages, nearly one hundred short stories across numerous genres, the odd published poem, and even a sci-fi musical. ... His latest series are Troubletwisters, a fantasy for middle grade readers co-written with Garth Nix, and Twinmaker, a near-future thriller for young adults (and old adults too). ... On the sci-fi front, ... several novels set in the Star Wars universe, many co-written with fellow-Adelaidean Shane Dix.  These include the Astropolis, Evergence, Orphans and Geodesica series, and the computer game tie-in The Force Unleashed ... His fantasy novels ... include the Books of the Change (The Stone Mage & the Sea, The Sky Warden & the Sun, and The Storm Weaver & the Sand) and the Books of the Cataclysm (The Crooked Letter...The Blood Debt, The Hanging Mountains, and The Devoured Earth)uhttp://seanwilliams.com/bio/00609nz  a2200205n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001500092130002200107430001200129642001200141643004000153644001200193645001200205646001200217670011900229670005500348nr 97009614 DLC19970815051105.5970312n| acaaaaaa|          |n ana     c  anr 97009614   aNNPMcNNPM 0aKunst der Graphik 0aGraphik  a65NNPM  aWienbIm Selbstverlag der Albertina  af5NNPM  at5NNPM  as5NNPM  aRembrandt, Radierungen aus dem Besitz der Albertina, 1970:bt.p. (Die Kunst der Graphik ; VI) spine (Graphik ; VI)  aRLIN, Mar. 11, 1997b(hdg.: Die Kunst der Graphik)00397cz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002500092100002900117400002900146670008800175nr 97009616 DLC20001115070807.0970312n| acannaabn          |a aaa     c  anr 97009616   aUPBbengcUPBdOCoLC1 aRodríguez Mesa, Rafael1 aMesa, Rafael Rodríguez  aRegímenes del sistema general de pensiones, 1995:bt.p. (Rafael Rodríguez Mesa)00503nz  a2200145n  45000010013000000030