ces for the events of that crusade. The chronicle is thought to have been written from 1212 to 1218, recounting events which were principally those of 1203 to 1208, but also later events, at some of which Peter himself was present as eyewitness ... The chronicle was not written after 1218, and it is suggested that Peter's death shortly after that year may be the reason")  aFrench Wikipedia, March 29, 2018b(Pierre des Vaux de Cernay  (or Pierre de Vaulx-Cernay), in Latin Petrus monachus coenibius Vallium Cernaii; a Cistercian monk of Vaux-de-Cernay Abbey, and a chronicler of the Albigensian Crusade; died after 1248 [sic, presumably an error for 1218])  aArchives de littérature du Moyen Âge (ARLIMA), March 29, 2017b(Pierre des Vaux-de-Cernay ; died after 1218; monk of the Cistercian abbey of Vaux-de-Cernay)  aBibliothèque nationale de France. BnF autorités, March 29, 2017b(Pierre des Vaux de Cernay, Cistercian of the 13th century00331cz  a2200121n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001800092100002300110670007600133nr 97010333 DLC20030912095427.0970317n| acannaab           |n aaa     c  anr 97010333   aNICcNICdDLC1 aFerraresi, Gisella  aLanguage change and generative grammar, 1996:bt.p. (Gisella Ferraresi)00393nz  a2200133n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001500092100003400107670005600141670006200197nr 97010334 DLC19970318052409.6970317n| acannaab|          |n aaa     c  anr 97010334   aMBMucMBMu1 aEhrenzweig, Anton,d1908-1966  aThe hidden order ... 1967:bt.p. (Anton Ehrenzweig)  aLC in RLIN, 3/17/97b(hdg.: Ehrenzweig, Anton, 1908-1966)00503cz  a2200145n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040003300092100003400125400003500159670005600194670010700250nr 97010337 DLC20001115070852.0970317n| acannaabn          |a aaa     c  anr 97010337   aMBMubengcMBMudMBMudOCoLC1 aNouaille-Rouault, Geneviève1 aRouault, Gene