uished and elegant composer was of an ancient and noble German family, and came over to this country with many other persons of consideration at the commencement of the French revolution; here he laudably availed himself of a peculiar native talent as a composer and teacher of music, in which profession he so eminently excelled; at the general peace of 1814 he left England to prosecute his claims for the recovery of the family property; his works, which are original, have long been considered as the standard of fine expression, united with good taste)  aNew Grove;aMGG00578cz  a2200157n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040002500092100003500117400003500152400004400187670009700231670009200328nr 97014161 DLC20001116070552.0970416n| acannaabn          |a aaa     c  anr 97014161   aNICbengcNICdOCoLC1 aAkram-Lodhi, A. Haroon,d1958-1 aLodhi, A. Haroon Akram-d1958-1 aAkram-Lodhi, A. H.q(A. Haroon),d1958-  aIn 'the house of the spirits', 1996:bt.p. (A. Haroon Akram-Lodhi) p. 17 (Akram-Lodhi, A.H.)  aRLIN database, 4/16/97b(Can. theses hdg.: Akram-Lodhi, A. Haroon (Agha Haroon), 1958-)00576nz  a2200193n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092130002900105410006000134642001900194643004800213644001100261645001100272646001100283670008800294nr 97014164 DLC19970510051332.9970416n| acaaaaaa|          |a ana     c  anr 97014164   aNICcNIC 0aState innovations briefs2 aCouncil of State Governments.tState innovations briefs  aP013-94025NIC  aLexington, KYbCouncil of State Governments  af5NIC  at5NIC  as5NIC  aArizona health care cost containment system, 1995:bp. 1 (State innovations briefs)00305nz  a2200121n  4500001001300000003000400013005001700017008004100034010001700075040001300092100001700105670006100122nr 97014166 DLC19970418071556.7970416n| acannaab|          |n aaa     c  anr 97014166   aNICcNIC1 aEbing, Ewald  aForm and function of